Side projects shouldn’t break the bank—here’s my cheat code: *use serverless and auto-suspend*. Run your dev envs on AWS Lambda or Cloudflare Workers (no idle costs!), and auto-shutdown EC2 instances after 30 mins of inactivity. Bonus: cache expensive API calls and precompute those "oh no, it’s slow again" moments. I once saved $180/month just by setting a cron to pause my dev DB at night. 🛌💰  
Pro tip: Set up AWS Budgets with Slack alerts—nothing like a panic message at 3 a.m. to remind you to scale down.

